-- Carysil AI — replace placeholder dealers with the real dealer network
-- from the dealer master sheet (Google Sheets export, 2026-10-21).
--
-- The old `dealers` table held 150 fabricated sample rows (ids d1..d150,
-- @carysil-dealers.com placeholder emails). This file removes every one of
-- them and loads the 1138 real dealers that `data/dealers.json` now
-- also holds (the chatbot reads dealer info from that JSON file at build
-- time; this table only exists so `leads.assigned_dealer_id` has something
-- to reference — keep both in sync when the dealer list changes again).
--
-- State was not in the source sheet (only Name/Address/City/Contact/Email);
-- it was derived from city/address and is informational only — the app
-- matches dealers by substring on city/state text (see
-- app/api/ai/concierge/handlers/dealer.ts), not by a controlled list.
--
-- Run in: Supabase Dashboard → SQL Editor → New query → Run
-- Any lead currently pointing at a removed placeholder dealer id (e.g. the
-- one referencing "d1") will have assigned_dealer_id set to NULL by the
-- existing ON DELETE SET NULL foreign key — nothing to do manually there.
--
-- Rollback: TRUNCATE dealers CASCADE;
--           INSERT INTO dealers SELECT * FROM dealers_backup_20261021;
-- ============================================================================

